{
  "_version": 5,
  "_readme": [
    "Faction Wars factions. Reload in-game with /taczarmedmobs war reload.",
    "members: single mobs ({\"entity\": \"modid:mob\"}) or entity tags ({\"tag\": \"#modid:tag\"}).",
    "  A single mob always wins over a tag. If two factions list the same mob, the first one in this file gets it.",
    "  Unknown mobs (mod not installed) are skipped with a warning.",
    "  spawn_weight: how often the mob is picked when a war spawns this faction. 0 or missing = never spawned.",
    "  role: fixed role shown on the nameplate (e.g. \"Brawler\"). Missing = picked from the weapon.",
    "  guns: true/false = this mob may / may not get TaCZ guns in wars. Missing = automatic: humanoid mobs",
    "  (zombies, skeletons, pillagers, vindicators, piglins, ...) and mobs from [extra_mobs] get guns.",
    "  A mob can be spawned by a faction it doesn't belong to (e.g. skeletons for the Wither): in a war it fights",
    "  for the faction that spawned it.",
    "exclude: mobs that belong to one of the tags but should NOT be part of the faction.",
    "hostile_to: enemy factions. One side is enough, enemies are always mutual.",
    "allied_with: allied factions (mutual). Allies never attack each other. Killing one of them also costs",
    "  reputation with its allies.",
    "arch_enemies: like hostile_to, but killing them earns double reputation with their enemies.",
    "neutral_to: explicitly neutral, overrides the family rule.",
    "family: the main faction a sub-faction belongs to (default: itself). Same family = allied. Between families",
    "  the entries of the two main factions count, unless the sub-factions have their own entries for each other.",
    "build_block: what engineers of this faction build cover walls and stairs from (default cobblestone).",
    "color: a Minecraft color name (red, dark_green, gold, ...) or a hex code like #FF8800."
  ],
